Step 4: Model comparison
Cross-validating logistic_regression ...
Cross-validating random_forest ...
Cross-validating gradient_boosting ...

[1] Ranking metrics
                     val_ap  val_ap_std  val_roc_auc
logistic_regression  0.2123      0.0113       0.6634
random_forest        0.2249      0.0140       0.6681
gradient_boosting    0.2330      0.0126       0.6732

Interpretation: gradient_boosting ranks best: AP 0.233, no-skill 0.114.
                Gains between models stay close to the fold-to-fold standard deviation (0.013).

[2] Train vs validation
                     train_ap  val_ap  train_minus_val_ap
logistic_regression    0.2181  0.2123              0.0059
random_forest          0.8559  0.2249              0.6310
gradient_boosting      0.3904  0.2330              0.1575

Interpretation: random_forest overfits most: train AP 0.86, validation 0.22.
                logistic_regression has the smallest gap (0.006): it underfits rather than overfits.

